<section class="answer"><p><strong>Short answer:</strong> The best Notion alternative depends on the part of Notion you want to replace. ClickUp is a strong fit for task-first teams, Slab is a focused company wiki, and Obsidian is better for local Markdown notes. Confluence, Nuclino, Anytype and Taskade cover other needs, but none copies every Notion feature.</p></section>
<h2 id="alternatives-at-a-glance">Best Notion alternatives at a glance</h2>
