<tr><td><a href="https://www.atlassian.com/software/confluence">Confluence</a></td><td>Enterprise wiki and Jira teams</td><td>Free up to 10 users</td><td>Standard shown from US$5.42/user/month; seat and billing calculator applies</td><td>Less flexible as a personal notes app</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="https://slab.com/">Slab</a></td><td>Focused company knowledge base</td><td>Free up to 10 users</td><td>Startup US$6.67/user/month; Business US$12.50, billed annually</td><td>Not a full project database system</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="https://www.nuclino.com/">Nuclino</a></td><td>Lightweight team wiki and docs</td><td>Free up to 50 items</td><td>Advanced plans start from US$6/user/month</td><td>Fewer deep workspace controls than Notion</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="https://obsidian.md/">Obsidian</a></td><td>Personal knowledge and local Markdown</td><td>Core app free</td><td>Sync US$4/user/month and Publish US$8/site/month, billed annually</td><td>Team collaboration and databases need more setup</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="https://anytype.io/">Anytype</a></td><td>Local-first private knowledge</td><td>Free with 100 MB remote storage</td><td>Plus US$4/month; Pro US$8; Ultra US$16</td><td>Different collaboration and sharing model</td></tr>
